out @OUT@
fps 30

# Relaxing ground-level views: camera just above the tall grass on open ground, very slow drift.
# H +6 puts the landscape first: grass is only a swaying strip along the bottom; look aims below the
# summit so the peak sits in the upper third with the valley and meadow beneath it.

